# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# index.html and assets/css/styles.css are generated and committed, and the
# project promises `npm run build` regenerates them byte-identically. Without
# this, a Windows checkout rewrites them to CRLF, a Linux build then produces a
# different byte sequence, and the deploy tests fail on nothing but line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary